00:20:55.530 --> 00:20:57.738
An underexposed image is a photograph

00:20:57.738 --> 00:21:01.350
that captures too few
details in the shadows.

00:21:01.350 --> 00:21:02.700
But in my series,

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:06.450
